WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.412
Ah! There you are, I was waiting for you to start touring La Grande Boutique!

00:00:20.504 --> 00:00:24.297
Welcome to Roland Garros 2021!

00:00:25.384 --> 00:00:26.136
We are at the bottom of the Philippe Chatrier court as you can see

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:32.798
this magnificent court was inaugurated last year,  and just by the Place des Mousquetaires

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.798
And to go to the Grande Boutique, we have to go down, follow me!

00:00:39.384 --> 00:00:42.136
In Cannes, we go up the stairs, here we walk them down...

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:52.798
To land at one of my favorite spots: the poster’s wall.

00:00:53.504 --> 00:00:55.297
It’s been going on for 40 years, it’s a tradition.

00:00:56.384 --> 00:01:02.136
Every year, one artist is selected to design the Roland-Garros poster

00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:04.798
Each one is more beautiful than the other.

00:01:05.504 --> 00:01:08.297
My favorite is the Björn Borg one, I have it at home

00:01:09.384 --> 00:01:13.136
and I’m quite proud of the one from my year of birth - 1990 -

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:16.798
the first poster with a woman on it!

00:01:19.504 --> 00:01:21.297
Hello, welcome to Roland Garros, would you like a bag?

00:01:22.384 --> 00:01:24.136
No it’s alright we’re here to take a tour, thank you so much.

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:26.798
Enjoy the visit!

00:01:27.504 --> 00:01:28.297
Thank you!

00:01:30.384 --> 00:01:33.136
we’ll start with the played tennis ball area, just by the entrance.

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:37.798
Hey,how are you?

00:01:39.504 --> 00:01:40.297
You’re a tennis ball boy?

00:01:41.384 --> 00:01:42.136
yes exactly

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:42.798
...

00:01:43.504 --> 00:01:44.004
you’re tall for a tennis ball boy!

00:01:44.384 --> 00:01:45.136
it’s the first time you’re doing this?

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:46.798
yes it’s my first time,

00:01:47.504 --> 00:01:48.297
But what are you doing here, shouldn’t you be on the court?

00:01:48.584 --> 00:01:50.136
I’m just coming back from it. I came to bring back the latest playedball.

00:01:52.220 --> 00:01:53.198
The ball played… so all of those are balls played?

00:01:53.504 --> 00:01:54.004
yes

00:01:56.384 --> 00:01:58.136
and they are for sale?

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:00.798
yes, they are packed and displayed here.

00:02:01.504 --> 00:02:02.297
that’s a great souvenir! I can see you have 2020, 2021…

00:02:03.184 --> 00:02:03.684
Exactly.

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:07.798
thank you so much for your explanations!

00:02:09.504 --> 00:02:10.297
You’re welcomed!

00:02:11.384 --> 00:02:12.136
You’re welcomed!

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:16.798
let’s move toward the Stringer area.

00:02:17.504 --> 00:02:18.297
it’s right there!

00:02:20.384 --> 00:02:25.136
One told me it moved this year so I’m a bit lost.

00:02:27.220 --> 00:02:29.798
well it’s in the boutique wilson.

00:02:30.184 --> 00:02:30.684
Ok

00:02:31.220 --> 00:02:32.798
and the cordage area is just there

00:02:33.384 --> 00:02:34.136
wow, it’s a nice area

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:34.798
yes

00:02:35.384 --> 00:02:36.136
Magnificent…

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:38.798
What is it? You’d like me to bring it over for you?

00:02:39.384 --> 00:02:39.884
yes if you don’t mind, please!

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:40.798
Sure, tell me what’s your tension
Hmm, 23-24 please

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:43.798
23-24, to pick up when?

00:02:44.384 --> 00:02:45.136
tomorrow if it’s possible

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:46.298
Tomorrow morning?

00:02:46.384 --> 00:02:47.136
Yes in the morning, that’s good

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:48.798
I’ll let them know you’ll come pick it up yourself

00:02:49.184 --> 00:02:49.936
though, I won’t do that for you!

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:50.798
Yes that’s cool, no worries! Thanks

00:03:00.384 --> 00:03:02.136
This is Roland-Garros's den, the backstage.

00:03:03.384 --> 00:03:07.136
They are 20 stingers at all times, from 11 different countries.

00:03:07.384 --> 00:03:10.136
Can someone take care of Harold Mayot’s racket please?

00:03:11.384 --> 00:03:12.136
Yes of course! Thanks

00:03:13.384 --> 00:03:15.136
It would be for tomorrow morning, 23-24!

00:03:17.384 --> 00:03:20.136
And if you have a springer available to give me and my guest some details 

00:03:22.384 --> 00:03:24.136
Yes of course! There you go…

00:03:24.384 --> 00:03:25.536
Are you available to talk to my guest here?

00:03:28.384 --> 00:03:30.136
Yes of course! It’s 23-24 correct?

00:03:30.384 --> 00:03:31.136
yes 23-24

00:03:32.384 --> 00:03:34.136
So they are 2 types of cordage: the mains and the cross.

00:03:35.384 --> 00:03:38.136
You are requesting 23 on the mains and 24 onthe cross.

00:03:39.384 --> 00:03:45.136
The tension depends on few parameters, including the player’s racket,

00:03:45.384 --> 00:03:50.136
its strings type, the temperature,the weather ect. Many parameters!

00:03:50.384 --> 00:03:52.136
if it’s warm it goes up, if cold, it goes down.

00:03:52.384 --> 00:03:53.136
Yes exactly!

00:03:53.384 --> 00:03:54.136
23-24 is standard correct?

00:03:54.384 --> 00:03:57.136
Yes! For men it’s a good average.

00:03:57.384 --> 00:03:59.136
are women higher or lower?

00:03:59.384 --> 00:04:00.136
A little higher.

00:04:00.384 --> 00:04:01.136
little higher?

00:04:01.384 --> 00:04:02.136
yes they play a little more flat.

00:04:02.384 --> 00:04:05.136
yes it makes sense. Well, thanks a lot!

00:04:05.384 --> 00:04:06.136
Bye!

00:04:12.384 --> 00:04:18.136
Believe the record is 450 rackets strings in a day.

00:04:19.384 --> 00:04:22.136
Which is huge! And on average, it takes 19 minutes

00:04:22.384 --> 00:04:26.136
I don’t know if you’ve ever tried that but it’s quite a performance.

00:04:26.384 --> 00:04:30.136
So here is the shop, with all those tennis balls hanging,

00:04:31.384 --> 00:04:35.136
seriously I love that! It’s mesmerizing.

00:04:36.384 --> 00:04:40.136
The shop is divided in 2 parts: the Roland-Garros brand just here,

00:04:40.384 --> 00:04:45.136
and there the Lacoste and Roland-Garros collaboration.

00:04:45.384 --> 00:04:50.136
So lets start with the Griffe Roland-Garros and my favorite area:

00:04:50.384 --> 00:04:54.136
clothing for kids, so cute, I can look at those for hours.

00:04:55.384 --> 00:04:57.136
Adeline,how are you?

00:04:57.384 --> 00:04:59.136
Hello Alize, I’m good and you?

00:04:59.384 --> 00:05:00.136
Good, what are you up to?

00:05:00.384 --> 00:05:04.136
well it’s my daughter’s birthday in a few days

00:05:04.384 --> 00:05:06.136
and she’s a tennis fan so I’m looking for an outfit.

00:05:06.384 --> 00:05:07.136
I have a crush on the dress.
You’re right, it’s too cute.

00:05:09.384 --> 00:05:11.136
and the skirt? What do you think?

00:05:11.384 --> 00:05:15.136
I prefer the dress, but it’s cute too. I would have to visualize it with a top but…

00:05:15.384 --> 00:05:17.136
the dress is too cute, you can’t go wrong with it.

00:05:17.384 --> 00:05:19.136
I’m with you on this, I’ll take the dress.

00:05:19.384 --> 00:05:21.136
Trust me, I’m sure it will suit her well.
Let’s do this then.

00:05:23.384 --> 00:05:24.136
Okay I let you do your shopping.

00:05:24.384 --> 00:05:26.136
thank you, bye!

00:05:26.384 --> 00:05:34.136
Let’s check out the towels’ wall. It’s a tradition every year.

00:05:34.384 --> 00:05:36.136
They are towels designed for the men and one for the women.

00:05:36.384 --> 00:05:39.136
We exchange them to get the whole collection.

00:05:39.384 --> 00:05:42.136
They are also the Night Sessions’ design and the one for the finale.

00:05:42.384 --> 00:05:44.136
Over all it’s 4 towels designed each year.

00:05:44.384 --> 00:05:50.136
And this one looks familiar… but it’s not from this year…

00:05:50.384 --> 00:05:59.136
I overheard you… and this year indeed, we are offering a range of upcycled towels, made from last year’s towels!

00:05:59.384 --> 00:06:02.136
Upcycled ? I know about recycling but not upcycling?

00:06:02.384 --> 00:06:09.136
Yes we used the towels from last year to transform them into bags and pouches.

00:06:09.384 --> 00:06:13.136
ok well this is smart, bravo! No waste then!

00:06:13.384 --> 00:06:16.136
and it will be easier to maintain.

00:06:16.384 --> 00:06:18.136
to wash yes!

00:06:18.384 --> 00:06:23.136
and it’s a good step for the planet.

00:06:23.384 --> 00:06:27.136
you are right, the environment. Bravo, excellent idea.

00:06:27.384 --> 00:06:28.136
Thank you!

00:06:28.384 --> 00:06:29.136
I let you go back to it!

00:06:29.384 --> 00:06:30.136
Goodbye!

00:06:30.384 --> 00:06:31.136
Goodbye!

00:06:32.384 --> 00:06:40.136
so then near the towels’ wall, we have the T-shirts’ wall. Just here.

00:06:40.384 --> 00:06:46.136
Hi hello I’m sorry to bother you.

00:06:46.384 --> 00:06:51.136
Is it possible to buy this single thing ?

00:06:51.384 --> 00:06:58.136
Yes, for sure ! Wait, let me scan it for you. Yeah, that’s good !

00:06:58.384 --> 00:07:02.136
It’s forty five please

00:07:02.384 --> 00:07:05.136
Perfect, thank you…

00:07:11.384 --> 00:07:16.136
Well look, there’s Fabrice. Fabrice?

00:07:16.384 --> 00:07:17.136
Hey!

00:07:18.384 --> 00:07:20.136
how are you? Hello!

00:07:22.384 --> 00:07:24.384
you know Axel from Lacoste?
So here is the string area. For the first time, it is visible to the public,it’s quite awesome.

00:07:24.384 --> 00:07:25.136
yes, I know him! What are you up to?

00:07:25.384 --> 00:07:29.136
we were just talking about the 50 years collaboration with Roland-Garros.

00:07:29.384 --> 00:07:31.136
This year, we will be celebrating 50 years.

00:07:31.384 --> 00:07:33.136
the brand’s 50th anniversary?

00:07:33.384 --> 00:07:34.136
50 years collaborating!

00:07:34.384 --> 00:07:36.136
the brand is even older!

00:07:36.384 --> 00:07:40.136
so the collaboration is a few months older than me.

00:07:40.384 --> 00:07:41.136
It’s your 50th birthday?

00:07:41.384 --> 00:07:43.136
for that we’ll have to wait another few months.

00:07:43.384 --> 00:07:46.136
so you are just a bit younger than the collaboration between Lacoste and Roland-Garros?

00:07:46.384 --> 00:07:47.136
Exactly.

00:07:47.384 --> 00:07:49.136
and what are you up to mark the occasion?

00:07:49.384 --> 00:07:53.136
Precisely, for the occasion we can customize polo shirts.

00:07:53.384 --> 00:08:01.136
And Fabrice, I am proud to offer you, your polo shirt, 50 years.
If you can talk about the tension, spring, all of that...

00:08:01.384 --> 00:08:06.136
Lucky you! An early birthday present! You’ll be able to wear it on your birthday.

00:08:06.384 --> 00:08:08.136
Can I wear it now?

00:08:08.384 --> 00:08:11.136
yes so you can start getting used to it!

00:08:11.384 --> 00:08:12.136
exactly.

00:08:12.384 --> 00:08:15.136
Isn’t it Rene Lacoste’s outline?

00:08:15.384 --> 00:08:17.136
Yes the “Basque Bondissant"

00:08:17.384 --> 00:08:19.136
So nice! Thank you so much!

00:08:19.384 --> 00:08:25.136
The customisation area is just back there. There are a few tags you can…

00:08:25.384 --> 00:08:27.136
add on a polo shirt?

00:08:27.384 --> 00:08:28.136
Everyone can choose to make their own.

00:08:28.384 --> 00:08:29.136
great idea!

00:08:30.384 --> 00:08:31.136
perfect thank you!

00:08:31.384 --> 00:08:32.136
you are spoiled.

00:08:33.332 --> 00:08:36.202
okay I have to go. I will head to the village area with my guest, upstairs.

00:08:36.461 --> 00:08:38.546
aren’t there sunglasses upstairs?
Let's move on with the shop. So I have some numbers for you:

00:08:38.546 --> 00:08:39.330
yes i believe so.

00:08:39.589 --> 00:08:41.416
I’ll head there with you then. I lost mine.

00:08:41.674 --> 00:08:42.458
okay then

00:08:42.717 --> 00:08:43.501
after you,

00:08:43.760 --> 00:08:44.544
bye Axel!

00:08:44.803 --> 00:08:46.629
by Axel, see you next time!

00:08:46.931 --> 00:08:50.758
Please help me pick one

00:08:51.059 --> 00:08:55.014
Have you seen the latest collection Roland-Garros Peformance?

00:08:55.315 --> 00:08:58.185
Nice, eclectic and amazing colors

00:08:58.444 --> 00:08:59.228
Fashion and sports!

00:08:59.486 --> 00:09:00.271
Exactly!

00:09:00.529 --> 00:09:04.484
Lacoste has been great in that respect: combining fashion and sports together

00:09:04.743 --> 00:09:11.698
Is it around here Village corner... I think you're at the right place to find your next sunglasses.

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:12.420
OK

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:13.650
Nice, this is the place for glasses.

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:14.650
I would still take your advice: it's never easy to pick shades.

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:19.650
OK, I'll let you browse for a bit and I'll get back to you.

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:20.650
Deal!

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:23.650
Let's keep going on the visit!

00:09:23.780 --> 00:09:24.650
Thanks Alize!

00:09:26.780 --> 00:09:32.650
Here is the "village area" with famous brands such as JM Weston. O2Feel is a very cool electric bike...

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:36.650
I would love to try it by the way, Sisley too...

00:09:37.780 --> 00:09:46.650
And this is the event corner: with photos, Celebrity meetups, virtual reality experiences:

00:09:47.780 --> 00:09:51.650
something special every day so that there is always something to discover.

00:09:51.780 --> 00:09:52.650
Hey Guy! How are you?

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:54.650
What a nice surprise Alize! Doing great!

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:55.650
What are you up to? Buying something special?

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:57.650
Exactly

00:09:57.780 --> 00:09:58.650
What is it? Is it like sand?

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:01.650
Just a slice of magic: the soil of the Philippe Chatrier tennis court, 

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:03.650
and anyone can get a piece of it here.

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:05.650
To make it even more unique!!

00:10:05.780 --> 00:10:06.650
Exactly

00:10:06.780 --> 00:10:08.650
OK, so one brings back sand from vacations at the beach and from Roland-Garros,

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:10.650
one would bring back with him the very magic soil of the tennis courts.

00:10:10.780 --> 00:10:16.650
Indeed! So happy to see you and looking forward to welcoming our public,

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:19.650
with a nice attendance this year, this will be an unforgettable edition.

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:22.650
Attendance? Last year it had to be 1,000 because of sanitary restrictions, and this year.this will be 5,000 right?

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:25.650
Last year, only 1,000 individuals were allowed in the central tennis court with the ability to wander in other areas.

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:31.650
This year, this will 1,000 per main tennis court so this will be around 5,000 people during the first week

00:10:31.780 --> 00:10:38.650
with upto 13,000 people during the 2nd week. For the finals, semi and quarter,

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:41.650
5,000 people on the central court.

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:42.650
Out of?

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:45.650
The central court has a 15,000 capacity usually.

00:10:45.780 --> 00:10:46.650
About a third then.

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:48.650
Not so bad considering last year situation.

00:10:48.780 --> 00:10:51.650
I thought that was less than that, 5,000 top at any moment.

00:10:51.780 --> 00:10:55.650
No, that's better than this, and also with a shiny new stadium ;

00:10:55.780 --> 00:11:00.650
and let me thank all our partners by the way: broadcasters,

00:11:00.780 --> 00:11:05.650
the whole tennis family, which has allowed us to display this brand new stadium with a magnificent roof.

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:08.650
We will have night sessions too, and that's a first.

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:13.650
That will be very soon, andwe're just ready.

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:14.650
Are you ready yourself?

00:11:14.780 --> 00:11:16.650
I'm born ready.

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:18.650
You must be so impatient, preparing for a year for this moment.

00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:20.650
Yes but it's a great meeting and we are getting ready for it all year long.

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:25.650
So that’s it, we can’t wait to have you here, come see us!

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:27.650
But there’s always a lot of people in Roland-Garros,

00:11:27.780 --> 00:11:30.650
everyone’s a fan. Even those whodon’t follow tennis are Roland-Garros fans.

00:11:30.780 --> 00:11:31.650
well enjoy the tour then! See you Alize!

00:11:36.780 --> 00:11:41.650
Mugs, key chains,notebooks, hats, bibs, posters…

00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:50.650
Wait, let me help you!

00:11:50.780 --> 00:11:52.650
Thank you, I have so many things!

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:55.650
of course! You know you can pay here directly at this terminal.

00:11:55.780 --> 00:11:58.650
Then I can have everything delivered directly to you.

00:11:58.780 --> 00:11:59.650
But I don’t live in Paris.

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:03.650
That’s not a problem. We deliver everywhere in France and abroad.

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:04.650
That’s great!

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:05.650
thank you so much!

00:12:12.780 --> 00:12:19.650
So here is the check out area and this year we have 3 innovations:

00:12:19.780 --> 00:12:25.650
You can ask for a mobile sales person, if you’re someone impatient, like me.

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:28.650
You can alsoorder from the app, starting at 80 euros purchases,

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:29.650
and then there is the Click&amp;Collect

00:12:29.780 --> 00:12:36.650
for the ones who don’t want to leave the court and miss a set,and can collect everything here.

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:47.650
But wait! I ordered a cap! Thank you! 

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:49.650
There’s an area where you can customize caps

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:57.650
and towels so I had mine customized in clay color, very original for Roland-Garros!

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:12.650
That’s it! This is the end of our tour! We’re back at the Posters’ Wall!

00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:19.650
I will go get my phone and take a selfie. This is so photogenic. 

00:13:19.780 --> 00:13:26.650
Thank you for following meon this visit! I hope you enjoyed it and that Roland-Garros 2021 will be magnificent!

00:13:27.021 --> 00:13:28.021
See you soon!

